    "Name": "Warhammer WHM-LAM-1C",
    "Details": "Fulfilling the initial goal of Project Thor's Hammer, the Warhammer LAM ver. C is able to take out a Clan's Thor Omnimech with a single pass, and survive the encounter. While single-kill mechs were often relegated to the trashbin in the planning stages, the necessity of defeating a mech, and then claiming the salvage during the early Clan Invasion, saw such units come to the forefront of battle for a brief period.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Land Air Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_warhammer"
  },
